                        "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                        "entry_id": "e3859a4e-a884-3162-8c25-01e26c74df9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Funeral rites."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02ac35cb-18f4-4183-9ea6-86475044e761",
                                "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                                "text": "But yet, before we go, let’s not forget\nThe noble Duke of Bedford late deceased,\nBut see his exequies fulfill’d in Rouen:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96cd6171-a525-4f3c-9fba-d3db7e5cd09a",
                                "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                                "text": "EDWARD. Whether goes my Lord of Couentrie so fast?\n BISHOP. To celebrate your fathers exequies,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89b9d02a-e274-4e57-869c-7d039bfb31e4",
                                "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                                "text": "Exequies of Saul obſerued with mourning weeping and faſting."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a920b70-4d82-4a87-b76f-af2cbd31f51d",
                                "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                                "text": "More ſerious conjectures finde ſome examples of ſepulture in Elephants, Cranes, the Sepulchrall Cells of Piſmires and practice of Bees; which civill ſociety carrieth out their dead, and hath exequies, if not interrments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01b34d39-e2df-45aa-8473-8ba1118784fd",
                                "sense_id": "fdbde2fd-6973-33ba-912b-d0b4d1677b47",
                                "text": "We were accelerating along the Perth Road at a speed much faster than is normally associated with exequies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
